{"kind":"html","caption":"用 Boyer-Moore 投票法维护候选人和票数：票数为 0 时接纳当前元素，相同则加票，不同则抵消一票。示例中元素 1 一度通过抵消清空候选资格，但后续的 2 重新成为候选人并最终留下。由于多数元素出现次数超过一半，它不可能被其他元素全部抵消，因此最终候选人就是答案；时间复杂度 O(n)，空间复杂度 O(1)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>多数元素可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  .panel { background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  p { margin: 4px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .mono, .value, .index, .metric-value { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .rule { color: #3794ff; font-size: 11px; }\n  .array { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 6px; }\n  .cell { width: 38px; min-height: 48px; padding: 4px 2px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 2px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s; }\n  .cell .value { font-size: 14px; }\n  .cell .index { font-size: 10px; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .cell.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.active .value { color: #fff; }\n  .cell.done { border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .state { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; margin-top: 6px; }\n  .metric { min-height: auto; background: #2d2d30; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px; }\n  .metric-label { color: #3794ff; margin-bottom: 2px; font-size: 10px; }\n  .metric-value { color: #3794ff; font-size: 13px; }\n  .explain { min-height: auto; margin-top: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #2a2d2e; font-size: 12px; }\n  .votes { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; min-height: 24px; margin-top: 6px; }\n  .vote { min-width: 28px; padding: 4px 6px; text-align: center; border-radius: 4px; background: #0e639c; border: 1px solid #3794ff; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; }\n  .empty { color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 11px; }\n  .result { color: #3794ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <h1>投票抵消过程</h1>\n    <p>示例：<span class=\"mono\">nums = [2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2]</span></p>\n    <p class=\"rule\">规则：同候选人加一票，不同则抵消一票；票数归零后，下一元素成为新候选人。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div id=\"array\" class=\"array\"></div>\n    <div class=\"state\">\n      <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">当前元素</div><div id=\"current\" class=\"metric-value\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">候选人</div><div id=\"candidate\" class=\"metric-value\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">票数</div><div id=\"count\" class=\"metric-value\">0</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"explain\" class=\"explain\">动画即将开始：候选人为空，票数为 0。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <p>尚未被抵消的票：</p>\n    <div id=\"votes\" class=\"votes\"><span class=\"empty\">暂无</span></div>\n    <p id=\"result\"></p>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const nums = [2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2];\n  const steps = [\n    { cand: 2, count: 1, text: '票数为 0，接纳 2 为候选人，并记 1 票。' },\n    { cand: 2, count: 2, text: '当前元素也是 2，与候选人相同，票数加 1。' },\n    { cand: 2, count: 1, text: '当前元素 1 与候选人 2 不同，双方抵消 1 票。' },\n    { cand: 2, count: 0, text: '又遇到 1，再抵消 1 票；票数归零。' },\n    { cand: 1, count: 1, text: '票数为 0，接纳当前元素 1 为新候选人。' },\n    { cand: 1, count: 0, text: '当前元素 2 与候选人 1 不同，抵消后票数归零。' },\n    { cand: 2, count: 1, text: '票数为 0，接纳最后一个 2；扫描结束，候选人是 2。' }\n  ];\n  const array = document.getElementById('array');\n  nums.forEach((n, i) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'cell';\n    cell.innerHTML = `<div class=\"value\">${n}</div><div class=\"index\">下标 ${i}</div>`;\n    array.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n  const cells = [...array.children];\n  const current = document.getElementById('current');\n  const candidate = document.getElementById('candidate');\n  const count = document.getElementById('count');\n  const explain = document.getElementById('explain');\n  const votes = document.getElementById('votes');\n  const result = document.getElementById('result');\n  let step = -1;\n\n  function render(i) {\n    cells.forEach((cell, idx) => {\n      cell.classList.toggle('active', idx === i);\n      cell.classList.toggle('done', idx < i);\n    });\n    if (i < 0) {\n      current.textContent = '—'; candidate.textContent = '—'; count.textContent = '0';\n      explain.textContent = '动画重新开始：候选人为空，票数为 0。';\n      votes.innerHTML = '<span class=\"empty\">暂无</span>';\n      result.textContent = '';\n      return;\n    }\n    const s = steps[i];\n    current.textContent = nums[i];\n    candidate.textContent = s.cand;\n    count.textContent = s.count;\n    explain.textContent = `第 ${i + 1} 步：${s.text}`;\n    votes.innerHTML = s.count > 0 ? Array.from({length: s.count}, () => `<span class=\"vote\">${s.cand}</span>`).join('') : '<span class=\"empty\">所有票已抵消</span>';\n    result.innerHTML = i === nums.length - 1 ? '最终多数元素：<span class=\"mono\">2</span>' : '';\n  }\n\n  render(step);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    step++;\n    if (step >= nums.length) step = -1;\n    render(step);\n  }, 1800);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":"","time_complexity":"O(n)","space_complexity":"O(1)","complexity_note":"n 为数组长度. Boyer-Moore 投票法只维护候选值和票数. 题目保证多数元素存在, 无须额外验证; 增加一次验证扫描也仍为 O(n)."}
